<size:22><b>Business Decisions</b></size>
<color:gray>Key business rules, policies, and decisions</color>
Each day is evaluated against that day's targets snapshot
No deviation is computed under a 7-day window
A deviation is sustained only if it persists across the majority of the window
A logging gap is not a deviation and never escalates
Consistency alerts prompt the patient first; escalation only after 3 weeks
Escalation notifies, it never modifies the plan
}
